 "description": "cancel stops the current run; spent credits are not refunded. retry only when the status has suggested_action=retry: it re-queues (no immediate start) and **uses one of today's slots**. Otherwise use huasheng_ask_agent. Call once, then huasheng_wait_for_project.",
